# What 'full' subtracts from the generated runtime list.
#
# The X server and the session around it, and Firefox. This distro runs cog on
# DRM: the browser is the graphical session, so an X server, a window manager
# and a terminal emulator on top of it are three things nothing starts.
#
# The X *libraries* are not here - mesa links them, see packages.list.
